  "zh": "# 今日热点聚焦AI突破、国际冲突与消费房市动态\n## AI 与科技\n- **英伟达宣布新突破**：发布下一代GPU架构，提升AI训练效率，预示算力竞赛新轮。\n- **MiniMax 发布新模型 M3.1-Flash**：多模态编程能力强，直接挑战国内外大模型生态。\n- **女子离婚6天用AI救了前夫一命**：通过急诊AI辅助诊断成功挽救生命，展示AI在医疗急救的实用价值。\n## 国际视野\n- **蒙古国草原火灾疑似是日本人“点的”**：火源指向外国引发外交关注，凸显跨境环境治理难题。\n- **法国爆发严重骚乱，超50万人上街**：反对养老改革引发全国性示威，暴露法国社会深层矛盾。\n- **以色列总理下令推翻伊朗政权**：升级中东地缘风险，可能引发地区军事对抗与能源价格波动。\n## 行业动向\n- **汇源集团不再生产汇源果汁**：转向新品牌咱家果源，反映传统果汁市场萎缩与品牌重塑。\n- **首个二手房涨价的城市出现**：某城市二手房价止跌回升，预示房地产市场可能迎来拐点。",
  "en": "# Today's highlights: AI breakthroughs, international tensions, and shifts in consumer and housing markets\n## AI & Tech\n- **NVIDIA announces new breakthrough**: unveils next‑gen GPU architecture boosting AI training efficiency, signaling a new round in the compute race.\n- **MiniMax releases M3.1‑Flash model**: multimodal programming model challenges domestic and global AI leaders.\n- **Woman uses AI to save ex‑husband after divorce**: AI‑assisted emergency diagnosis saves a life, showing real‑world medical value.\n## International\n- **Mongolia grassland fire suspected ignited by Japanese**: foreign‑origin fire claim sparks diplomatic concern and highlights cross‑border environmental governance.\n- **France sees violent protests with over 500k on streets**: massive anti‑pension‑reform demonstrations expose deep social fissures.\n- **Israeli PM orders overthrow of Iranian regime**: escalates Middle East geopolitical risk, raising prospects of regional conflict and oil price swings.\n## Industry\n- **Huiyuan Group stops producing Huiyuan juice**: shifts to new brand “Our Fruit Source”, reflecting shrinking traditional juice market and brand overhaul.\n- **First city sees second‑hand home price rise**: a city’s resale housing prices turn upward, hinting at a possible inflection point in the property market."
